      "content": "I'm conducting a failure analysis on a new asphalt section in Phoenix that is exhibiting premature longitudinal cracking. I need a technical breakdown of the failure mechanisms involved, specifically focusing on the interplay between thermal expansion/contraction cycles, bitumen viscosity at application temperatures, and the role of subgrade compaction in mitigating these stresses. Please provide a professional summary.",
